  "limits": [
    "The task ZIP is a saved snapshot. Unsent input and unsaved edits are excluded; later execution requires another explicit download.",
    "Only materialized runs receive execution records. Queued and cancelled messages retain their conversation state.",
    "Context manifests and saved evidence are included; external knowledge stores or attachments are not downloaded.",
    "Maximum uncompressed content is 256 MiB, with a separate 64 KiB manifest limit. Generation/compression remain in memory; these limits are not a peak-memory guarantee.",
    "Verification checks hashes and internal consistency. It is not a digital signature, proof of provenance or a declaration of task success.",
    "This is task delivery/inspection, not an import or whole-workspace backup. Existing run-export commands and bundles remain supported.",
    "Browser success means handed to the browser download manager, not proof of final disk persistence. Closing a pending request aborts the browser fetch; server work may already have started.",
    "Desktop layout coverage is two widths and enlarged dialog text, not every device or uniform page zoom.",
    "Focused and full test counts overlap. Version remains 1.3.0; no publication or repeated fresh installation."
  ]
